bst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3iqshZ3KrzQQ7kNvwE0_1xv&_nc_oc=AdpszYb8Gy3Rl62xIKir3kCCmlw9ME45ID-aqquvDwUuZSNTsK70jHvl04dTvrvTHWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af08ly8mFZ4WwyoHbcHP-3KALcKcelX5PBwovNTrDU7IUQ&oe=69F1F5D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3jSQ9EYwzMsQ7kNvwEI4gSV&_nc_oc=AdrVWJdbULqcGWISPrm50LffeMRSxFIJbpyW43AAG18pE2o55Zyh25qQwNF1gwAgLi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0MzTeiuBMCMblX6221AcBU5-Wbx_O8I6zFqbkP2h8oeA&oe=69F1FFAD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X3_N4YurNMAQ7kNvwG-f-3E&_nc_oc=AdrKYb9Or1fAZWd3h_AWVlmKmyb7Phl6tIIU948TdnJ72ylK1JGZHvf4TL6V2PIgKmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af34J3-Eg0PojjYRCnwTvehCmXjxjQgtKCZy-L6DTwCvRQ&oe=69F1F7ED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1YUjHvKR7R4Q7kNvwG5kYIV&_nc_oc=Adpjuxhk